+1.  **Vertex Arrays:**
+    -   `vertex0`: `Uint32Array` of packed 32-bit integers. Each vertex uses one entry.
+    -   `vertex1`: `Uint32Array` of packed 32-bit integers. Each vertex uses one entry.
+    -   `indices`: `Uint32Array` of triangle indices.
+2.  **Free List:**
